        },
        {
          "text": "Aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo hagume hazeho orurango rw'orusiisira rw'oruganda rwa Reubeeni, nk'oku emitwe yaabo eri; omwebembezi waabo abe Elizuuri mwene Shedeuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
