        {
          "text": "Boona abaabazirwe omu kicweka kya Reubeeni bakaba bari abashaija akasiriira n'obukumi butaano na rukumi na magana ana na makumi ataano, nk'oku amahe gaabo gaabaire gari. Abo babe nibo baaba aba kabiri omu kwimutsya orugyendo.",
