        },
        {
          "text": "Boona abaabazirwe omu kicweka kya Daani bakaba bari abashaija akasiriira n'obukumi butaano n'enkumi mushanju na magana mukaaga. Abo babe nibo baaguma nibahereeruka, nk'endango zaabo oku ziri.",
          "type": "text",
