        {
          "text": "Abo nibo Baisraeli abaabazirwe nk'oku amaju ga baishenkurubo gaabaire gari; ab'omu nsiisira boona abaabazirwe nk'amahe gaabo oku gaabaire gari, bakaba bari abashaija obusiriira mukaaga n'enkumi ishatu na magana ataano na makumi ataano. ",
