              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baakozire, nk'ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa byona oku byabaire biri. Nikwo baagumire nibateera amahema gaabo nk'endango zaabo oku zaabaire ziri, kandi nikwo baabaire baimutsya orugyendo, buri muntu omu ruganda rwe, n'omu muryango gwa baishenkuru.",
